# Design System

Use semantic tokens from `app/globals.css` — `bg-primary`, `text-primary`, `text-muted-foreground`, `border-border`. Do not introduce ad hoc hex colors.

## Surfaces

| Surface | Shell |
|---------|-------|
| Public | `MainHeader` + `MainFooter`, `max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8` |
| Auth | `AuthPageShell` + `AuthFormPanel` + `AuthFormTitle` |
| Admin / customer | Route-group layout + sidenav |

## Typography

Page titles: `lusitana` from `@/app/fonts`. Public heroes scale `text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl`.

## Components

- Primitives: `@/components/ui/*` (shadcn new-york)
- Shared: `components/shared/`, `components/layout/`
- Route UI: `app/.../_components/`

## Copy

Spanish (es-AR). Voseo on public/auth (`Ingresá`, `Completá`); neutral labels on admin forms.

## Deeper guidance

For full design or UX review workflows, use the **ui-design** skill (`.cursor/skills/ui-design/`).
